{
  "_comment": [
    "WHERE a KourOS listen was played from — the vectors two implementations must agree on.",
    "The Android app's PlayContext.kt (its JVM unit test) and the server's grammar",
    "(apps/kouros/backend/src/playContext.js, held by test/native.mjs with JavaScript's own",
    "encodeURIComponent) both pass every case. `expect: null` = no context (the listen is kept",
    "without one). Album/artist names are hostile on purpose: they are real library names."
  ],
  "maxLen": 600,
